  <section>
    <h3>Our mission</h3>
    <p>TipPal exists to make gratitude simple, direct, and pressure-free. We believe the people who make your day — your rideshare driver, the waiter who served you, the housekeeper who tidied your room, the creator who inspired you — deserve to receive every bit of the appreciation you send them, without algorithms taking a cut or platforms diluting the gesture.</p>
    <p>Our mission is to return gratitude to what it was always meant to be: a human gift, given freely and received in full.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>How we approach it</h3>
    <p>TipPal is the first app built exclusively for processing gratitude in person, across every sector — not just the traditional service industry. We use Tap to Pay and standard payment rails through our processing partner, Stripe, so the experience stays fast and familiar while the funds reach the person you intended.</p>
    <p>For the structure and protections behind the Service, see our <a href="/security">security page</a> and our <a href="/legal">Terms of Service and Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </section>

